# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Vercel upload slimming
#
#  Only the files needed to BUILD and SERVE the site are uploaded to Vercel.
#  Everything else (docs, tests, local tooling, design sources, archives) is
#  skipped, which keeps deployments fast and avoids shipping editor/OS noise.
#
#  ⚠️  Do NOT exclude anything the build actually needs:
#        index.html, package.json, package-lock.json, vite.config.ts,
#        tsconfig*.json, src/, public/
#  ⚠️  If you ever point vercel.json's "ignoreCommand" at a script file, that
#      script must NOT be listed here or Vercel will not find it.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Version control & CI ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# ── Documentation ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.md
docs
doc
LICENSE
CHANGELOG*
CONTRIBUTING*

# ── Tests ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
tests
test
__tests__
e2e
cypress
playwright-report
coverage
.nyc_output
*.test.*
*.spec.*

# ── Scripts & local tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
scripts
tools
bin
Makefile
*.sh
*.bash
*.ps1
*.bat

# ── Original design source files ────────────────────────────────────────────
*.psd
*.ai
*.sketch
*.fig
*.xd
*.afdesign
*.afphoto
*.blend
*.indd
*.eps
*.cdr

# ── Archives & documents (none are served directly by the frontend) ────────
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.tar
*.gz
*.tgz
*.bz2
*.xz
*.pdf
*.ppt
*.pptx
*.doc
*.docx
*.xls
*.xlsx

# ── Dependencies, build output & caches ─────────────────────────────────────
node_modules
dist
build
out
.vercel
.vite
.cache
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Editor & OS noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp

# ── Logs & temporary files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
tmp
temp
